Rishabh Shukla,[1] Ajay Kumar,[1] Ravi Kumar,[2] S. N. Jha,[3] and R. S. Dhaka[1,] _[ ∗]_ 

> 1 _Department of Physics, Indian Institute of Technology Delhi, Hauz Khas, New Delhi-110016, India_ 

